│ +DirtBeetle OLED Layout (Stationary Role) - 128x64 SSD1306
│ +Font: ArialMT_Plain_10, TEXT_ALIGN_LEFT, WHITE
│ +
│ +Row 1 (y=0):  "LK %+6.1f\""  (locked) or "   %+6.1f\"" (unlocked)
│ +  Example: "LK +012.3\"" or "   -0.8\""
│ +  Width: ~52px max (fits 128px easily)
│ +
│ +Row 2 (y=12): "TX %lu" or "TX %luk" (if >= 10000)
│ +  Example: "TX 123" or "TX 12k"
│ +  Width: ~30px max
│ +
│ +Row 3 (y=24): "RX %lu %lus" or "RX %lu --" (if age >= 10s)
│ +  Example: "RX 0 3s" or "RX 5 --"
│ +  Width: ~50px max
│ +
│ +Row 4 (y=36): "E%lu st:%d"
│ +  Example: "E0 st:0" or "E3 st:-4"
│ +  Width: ~40px max
│ +
│ +Row 5 (y=48): "%.0fPa"
│ +  Example: "91868Pa"
│ +  Width: ~45px max
│ +
│ +All rows fit within 128px width. No truncation needed.
